extraction_notes: "MONEY CAME OFF A WELDED PAGE AND WAS DE-WELDED BY HAND. Printed 42 is one of two pages in this book where pymupdf returned a single text block holding BOTH columns'' lines, so the cached text interleaves the Money paragraph with the quarters prose and no column reader can fix it - BOOK-INGEST-AUDIT.md F30. Read from the page''s word geometry, the line is ''Monthly salary is 2100 credits. Starts off with one month''s pay.'' This is the same field and the same failure shape as the two Juicer Uprising errors of PR #280, arriving by a different route. The Cybernetics line came off the same welded page: ''clock calendar and gyro-compass, plus select one additional cybernetic implant or bionic eye.'' MILITARY''S PRINTED +10% IS NOT APPLIED - see the related-skills note; it is stated for three named skills and a category carries one number. NO RHV-60 IN equipment_starting: the Reloader Hover Vehicle is imported as a `vehicles` row (printed 60-61) and equipment_starting can only reference `gear` slugs. The book describes it inside this O.C.C. entry rather than in the vehicle chapter, which is worth knowing when reading printed 41."
